  ]
} [
  <desc ?desc>
  halfcode-compiler.xnl 的唯一公开 npm capsule；0.2.2 candidate 保留十个既有 specifiers，并从 resource-core additive 暴露 loaded identities、effective identity projector、layered registry 与 dependency snapshot。
  </?desc>
  <capsule-tree ?tree>
  packages/distribution/package.json # public identity/version authority: 0.2.2 candidate
